<p><strong>Evidence query (example, verify before use):</strong></p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[SELECT user, host FROM mysql.user
 WHERE user = '' OR (host = '%' AND user IN ('root', 'admin'));]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
<p><strong>Remediation (example, apply through change management):</strong></p>
<ac:structured-macro ac:name="code"><ac:plain-text-body><![CDATA[DROP USER ''@'localhost';
DROP USER ''@'%';
RENAME USER 'root'@'%' TO 'root'@'localhost';]]></ac:plain-text-body></ac:structured-macro>
